{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْعَصْرِ","d":"wal-ʿaṣri","e":"By the time"}],"a":{"g":"By time,"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانَ","d":"l-insāna","e":"mankind"},{"c":"لَفِي","d":"lafī","e":"(is) surely in"},{"c":"خُسْرٍ","d":"khus'rin","e":"loss"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, mankind is in loss,"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believe"},{"c":"وَعَمِلُوا","d":"waʿamilū","e":"and do"},{"c":"الصَّالِحَاتِ","d":"l-ṣāliḥāti","e":"righteous deeds"},{"c":"وَتَوَاصَوْا","d":"watawāṣaw","e":"and enjoin each other"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"to the truth"},{"c":"وَتَوَاصَوْا","d":"watawāṣaw","e":"and enjoin each other"},{"c":"بِالصَّبْرِ","d":"bil-ṣabri","e":"to [the] patience"}],"a":{"g":"Except for those who have believed and done righteous deeds and advised each other to truth and advised each other to patience."}}}